_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":96,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-5bac8e128bc7f9101667","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-eabd185e649b4baa6dff","layer":"original","quote":"晔年十三，谓兄涣曰：“亡母之言，可以行矣！”涣曰：“那可尔！”晔即入室，杀侍者，径出拜墓。舍内大惊，白普。普怒，遣人追晔。晔还，拜谢曰：“亡母顾命之言，敢受不请擅行之罚。”普心异之，遂不责也","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":267,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":193,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
